          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"people5 mbr-embla\" group=\"People\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"embla\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" inline>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" inline>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcon\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#99ca3c\" selected condition=\"showIcon\">\n        <header>Carousel</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"autoplay\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Interval\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" step=\"1\" condition=\"autoplay\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Loop\" name=\"loop\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Draggable\" name=\"draggable\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrows\" title=\"Arrows\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrowsMobile\" title=\"Mobile Arrows\" condition=\"arrows\">\n        <header>Slides</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"gap\" title=\"Gap\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Title\" name=\"showDesk\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/pic4-1-1920x655.jpg\" selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"position-relative text-center\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n            <b>What Our Fantastic Users Say</b>\n        </h3>\n\n        <div class=\"embla\" data-loop=\"{{loop}}\" data-auto-play=\"{{autoplay}}\" data-auto-play-interval=\"{{interval}}\" data-draggable=\"{{draggable}}\" data-skip-snaps=\"true\" data-align=\"center\">\n            <div class=\"embla__viewport\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n                <div class=\"embla__container\">\n                    <div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                        <div class=\"user\">                            \n                            <div class=\"user_text mb-2\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                    Anphabe mong muốn truyền cảm hứng Xây Dựng Nguồn Nhân Lực Hạnh Phúc tới hàng ngàn doanh nghiệp Việt. Song song với thực hiện chương trình này, chúng tôi cũng sẽ đóng vai trò ‘kết nối’ để nhân rộng các chiến lược và thực hành hay từ các doanh nghiệp được chứng nhận để giúp cộng đồng cùng phát triển kinh doanh hiệu quả hơn nhờ sự đầu tư vào chiến lược môi trường làm việc và phát triển con người bền vững.</p>\n                            </div>                            \n                            <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">\n                                <span class=\"fas fa-quote-right mbr-iconfont\"></span><br>\n                                <b>Bà THANH NGUYỄN</b>\n                            </div>\n                            <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">GĐĐH &amp; Truyền cảm hứng Hạnh Phúc Anphabe</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--prev\">\n                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--next\">\n                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
